invariant: INV-16
file: poly1305_vector.h
catches: test/widemul-builds.sh
reason: poly1305_vector.h turns the vector Poly1305 on in every file of a
  CHACHA=vector WIDEMUL=runtime object, so poly1305.c under its own
  names, which the answer CH_WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED runs, multiplies on
  UMULL, UMLAL or PMULUDQ. The tags are the same. test/widemul-builds.sh
  requires poly1305.c in that object to call neither vector name.

--- old
#if defined(CH_CHACHA_VECTOR) && defined(CH_WIDEMUL_NATIVE)
--- new
#if defined(CH_CHACHA_VECTOR) && (defined(CH_WIDEMUL_NATIVE) || defined(CH_WIDEMUL_RUNTIME))
